to successfully complete the development of, and obtain the marketing approvals necessary to commercialize, one or more of our product candidates. We do not anticipate
generating revenue from product sales unless and until we obtain regulatory approval for, and commercialize, Keyzilen®, AM-111 or AM-125. Our ability to generate future
revenue from product sales depends heavily on our success in many areas, including but not limited to:
